### Requisições de exemplo (extensão REST Client do VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Cadastro
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "senha-segura-123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@email.com",
  "password": "senha-segura-123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Criar tarefa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Configurar pipeline de CI",
  "description": "GitHub Actions rodando mvn verify",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Listar com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=TODO&priority=HIGH&page=0&size=10&sort=dueDate,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mudar status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}
